                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{ V_i \overset{\iota_i}{\longrightarrow} U \}
              in the coverage, such that for each
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
